===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nl|veugel}} (obsolete)

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Nl-vogel.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}
* {{hyphenation|vo|gel|lang=nl}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|vogel}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|fogal}}, {{m|odt|vogal}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*fuglaz}}.

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-s|pl2=-@en|vogeltje|dim2=vogelijn}}

# A [[bird]], feathered animal
# A [[gaai]], a [[feathered]] target in [[archery]] or [[shooting]]
# {{lb|nl|figuratively||slang}} A [[dude]], {{l|en|cat}}

====Usage notes====
The word ''vogel'' is one of the few words where the obsolete Dutch diminutive suffix {{term|-lijn|lang=nl}} can still be encountered: {{term|vogelijn||little bird|lang=nl}} is chiefly poetic and can be found in poems and songs, but is not often used elsewhere.

